# the FM pages: a third press on an FM voice; the algorithm overridden, kept by the piece; a non-FM voice: back
listen
wait 3000
tap ENV
wait 200
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Keys
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 400
said Chord FM page, voice Keys: Algo Voice, Ratio 0, Feedback 0, LFO +25
expect view 12
spin K1 1
wait 300
expect par52 1
said Algo 1
spin K3 40
wait 300
expect par54 40
wait 4000
expect peak_db_max -0.5
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
turn ALGO -1
wait 300
said VOICE Saws
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
# (Saws isn't FM: the page's knobs grey at 0, and turning them changes nothing; Keys' feedback, 40, kept)
spin K3 -40
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect par54 40
expect par52 1
shot fm_off.png
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 13
spin K1 9
wait 3000
expect par56 9
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# the fourth knob, the LFO, works on every voice: on Saws (not FM) the FM page greys the rest but not it
tap HOME
tap ENV
wait 300
expect par22 0
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
spin K4 30
wait 300
expect par55 55
spin K1 3
wait 300
expect par52 1
